model sr
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, M3 C6, #192's G1 N-c (L §5.18 solve): the bracket's literals and step take the unknown's type, a rate (%/year) and a num with a unit (num PLN); each on a fine grid and a coarse one, where the nearest grid point is not the root (157.14 PLN against 158 PLN on lo + 7 PLN i from -10 PLN)"

source card "T's card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input base: money PLN

input rate: rate

input price: num PLN

input qty: num

input target: money PLN

def grown: money PLN = round(base * (1 + rate * 1 year), minor(PLN), half-up)

def cost: money PLN = round(qty * price, minor(PLN), half-up)

version v
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  base = 1 000.00 PLN
  rate = 3 %/year
  price = 2.5 PLN
  qty = 7
  target = 1 100.00 PLN

ask g: grown, cost
ask s_rate: solve grown == target for rate in [0 %/year, 20 %/year] to 0.0001 %/year
ask s_rate_coarse: solve grown == target for rate in [0 %/year, 20 %/year] to 0.4 %/year
ask s_price: solve cost == target for price in [0 PLN, 1 000 PLN] to 0.01 PLN
ask s_price_coarse: solve cost == target for price in [-10 PLN, 403 PLN] to 7 PLN
